<title>SWITZERLAND: Forbo sales rise one pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Forbo sales rise one pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>EGLISAU, Switzerland 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group sales		    1,918	     plus  1 percent</p>
<p>by division:</p>
<p> Floorcoverings		 1,013	     plus  4 percent</p>
<p> Decorative products	    353	     minus 1 percent</p>
<p> Systems technology	     552	     minus 3 percent.</p>
<p>NOTE - Forbo Holding AG said group turnover rose based on a better fourth quarter than the year before and favourable currency influences. It did not provide more detailed figures.</p>
<p>The annual results news conference was set for March 24 at 0930 GMT and the shareholder meeting for April 22.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-258 7340</p>
</text>
